1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:52,400
500 years ago

25
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,280
That bastard Lin Yi

26
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,320
sent us here to die.

27
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:31,840
Heng Yuezi
Heng Yue Sect Founder
Late stage Nascent Soul

28
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,360
Stop complaining

29
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,400
and focus on finding a way out.

30
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,520
A spatial rift !

31
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,520
That was close !

32
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,520
Go !

33
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,040
Thank you.

34
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:03,200
I, Piao Nanzi, will repay this debt.

35
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:07,320
Brother, you don't need to worry about such small matters.

36
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,440
These spatial rifts are unpredictable.

37
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,040
Their suction force

38
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:16,000
can overpower even a Giant Demon Clan's Nascent Soul.

39
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,240
I heard that those spatial rifts

40
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:22,000
can forcibly extract the spiritual energy from your body.

41
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:27,240
Who knows what lies beyond them in the void ?

42
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,600
Save me !

43
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,240
Please, someone help me !

44
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:34,160
500 years later

45
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:44,200
Wandering soul

46
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:41,320
700 years later

47
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,240
My Divine Sense

48
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,000
needs to get stronger.

49
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:38,800
Still not enough...

50
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,840
You’ve crossed the line.

51
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:43,960
Who are you ?

52
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:55,120
Soul Devourer

53
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:55,200
You... You’re a new Soul Devourer ?

54
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,040
Soul Devourer ?

55
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,240
After so many years

56
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,520
I finally have a new companion !

57
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,360
We are Soul Devourers

58
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,840
but what does it mean ?

59
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,840
Those twin-horned creatures are wandering souls,

60
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,840
they’re our prey.

61
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,080
How do I leave this place ?

62
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,000
Leave ?

63
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,870
Why do you want to leave ?

64
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,160
There’s no way to leave.

65
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:15,160
Can’t we tear a spatial rift to try to leave ?

66
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,920
Smashing it from the inside won’t work.

67
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:20,040
The spatial rifts only open from outside.

68
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,680
The cultivators outside fight for treasures

69
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,800
and kill each other

70
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,720
in brutal battles...

71
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,160
Get to the point.

72
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,560
We must wait

73
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:30,240
about 40 000 years.

74
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,720
No... 42 000...?

75
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,960
You said the cultivators outside cause spatial rifts

76
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,200
when they fight each other for treasures.

77
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,280
Will it work with Divine Sense ?

78
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,480
Go northwest,

79
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,600
a strange empty Divine Sense appeared there.

80
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:58,520
Xu Hao
Lingwu Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

81
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,440
Little brother,

82
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,720
you need to eat.

83
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,760
You’ll die if you keep using your energy.

84
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,160
Even if it's been 300 years here

85
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:28,840
only 3 years have gone by outside the spatial rift.

86
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,760
I know you want to leave

87
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,360
but your method will not work.

88
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:36,640
Even if your Divine Sense is able to cross the rift,

89
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:39,040
as long as your soul and body aren't in the same place

90
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,880
you won't be able to recover your body.

91
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:52,640
This is a treasure

92
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,320
that was fated to be mine !

93
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,320
Kun Bu
Posuo Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

94
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,160
There really is some Divine Sense here.

95
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:12,680
Junior Brother, what you're doing is inappropriate.

96
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,430
Ge Yang
Lingwu Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

97
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:17,480
Fellow cultivator,

98
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,000
what do you mean by this ?

99
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:21,960
And what do YOU mean by not letting go ?

100
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,160
Junior Brother,

101
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:27,360
he found that Divine Sense first.

102
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:28,520
Don't fight for it.

103
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,120
At least your Senior Brother is reasonable.

104
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:34,610
If you don’t let go now,

105
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,680
don’t blame me for being ruthless !

106
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,090
Unreasonable arrogance

107
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,520
is the root of your defeat.

108
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,040
I’ll teach you

109
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:06,800
what your Senior Brother failed to !

110
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:24,080
How long will you keep watching ?

111
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,720
I only just got a chance to act.

112
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,160
You must always be careful.

113
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,960
Consider your bag of holding

114
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:47,000
the payment for this lesson.

115
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,720
This thing is really weird.

116
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,240
What is it ?

117
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:58,400
There too much empty Divine Sense here.

118
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,640
The more treasures, the better.

119
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:03,080
But it would make sense

120
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:06,200
if a high rank country had sent someone to investigate this matter.

121
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,600
Why haven't they made their move already ?

122
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,080
Let's keep searching.

123
00:10:21,570 --> 00:10:31,540
Note: The appearance of these characters is the same as the ones attacking Situ Nan in episode 1. These are just reused assets and not the same characters.

124
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:28,640
The Foreign Battlefield has been unstable lately.

125
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,040
How odd,

126
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:35,920
it was fine when I last went.

127
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,360
It's only been 50 years,

128
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:40,040
how could it suddenly be unstable ?

129
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:41,440
The thing is,

130
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:44,600
only Foundation Establishment cultivators can enter.

131
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,920
So it's more likely that a Soul Transformation like you

132
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:48,480
did something.

133
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,440
What did you say !?

134
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,240
Enough, enough.

135
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:54,440
All the cultivators cleaning the battlefield

136
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,720
are obsessed with

137
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:58,560
the regular appearance of an empty Divine Sense.

138
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:02,720
There’s an unknown variable at play here.

139
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:05,560
I saw no Divine Sense back then.

140
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:06,760
No one accused you.

141
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:11,040
The Foreign Battlefield is unstable by nature.

142
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:12,640
No one inside can leave

143
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,160
and no one outside can enter.

144
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,200
Let’s hear your suggestions.

145
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,600
We ask our rank 6 country for help.

146
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,880
You're crazy !

147
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:22,360
They're too expensive.

148
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:25,320
If we don't have a solution,

149
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:27,760
then we let the Foundation Establishment cultivators

150
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:30,080
fend for themselves.

151
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:36,160
By the way, I revoked Zhao's qualifications.

152
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,360
No objections ?

153
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,360
I have an idea.

154
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,960
Send them a message:

155
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,840
"The cleanup is cancelled.

156
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,520
Focus on finding the Divine Sense.

157
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:53,960
In 3 days,

158
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,560
we will activate the teleportation formation

159
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,920
and evacuate everyone."

160
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,440
At worst,

161
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:01,640
we can pretend this cleanup never happened.

162
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,800
Alright, let's do that.

163
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:18,640
Finally...

164
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:23,560
3 days !

165
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:24,920
I’ve chased you for 3 days.

166
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,100
Once I get you,

167
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,920
I’ll return to the rally point.

168
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:31,000
Of all the disciples from the War God Shrine,

169
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,760
less than 10 survived.

170
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:35,840
The Sect Leader will surely favor me now

171
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,800
and make me a core disciple !

172
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,200
When that happens,

173
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:41,440
even Junior Sister will look at me differently !

174
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:49,760
Xu Hao ?

175
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,080
Ge Yang ?

176
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:55,400
These two are famous for murdering

177
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,960
and stealing treasures.

178
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:59,440
It looks like I’ll either die

179
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:01,360
or be skinned alive.

180
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:04,280
How dare you address us by name ?

181
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,080
Senior Brother Ge.

182
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,680
Senior Brother Xu.

183
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,720
So...

184
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,600
Is this yours ?

185
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:13,560
Not at all.

186
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,360
This empty Divine Sense

187
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,210
belongs to whoever claims it first.

188
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,200
Trash...

189
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,360
What else do you have ?

190
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:38,840
Senior Brothers,

191
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:41,760
these are all the treasures I found here.

192
00:13:42,640 --> 00:13:43,920
You can take them all

193
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,760
but just spare my life

194
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:47,960
and let me return to the Burning Fire country.

195
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:52,720
You’re the most spineless person I have ever met

196
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:55,000
but also the smartest.

197
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:56,960
Alright,

198
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,720
I’ll let you go this time.

199
00:13:58,840 --> 00:13:59,920
Now scram.

200
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,080
You...

201
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,880
I never said I'd let you go.

202
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:27,880
How kind of you.

203
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:30,560
Next time, I'll kill him myself.

204
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:32,640
You won't have to trouble yourself, Senior Brother.

205
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:55,360
I want your body,

206
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,160
dead man.

207
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,600
I’ll give you everything.

208
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,960
I just want

209
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,480
you to kill them for me.

210
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,240
Deal.

211
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:34,440
Wang Lin
Late stage Foundation Establishment

212
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:45,920
Teng Huayuan...

213
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,680
I, Wang Lin,

214
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:49,160
am coming back.

215
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:54,040
Divine Sense,

216
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,120
return !

217
00:17:12,510 --> 00:19:14,310
There are multiple instances of Foreign Battlefields. Rank 4 countries compete with eachother regularly and low level countries cleanup after them. That is why only Foundation Establishment cultivators can enter the cleanup but in the flashback we see the Nascent Soul Ancestors of Xuan Dao and Heng Yue, Lin Yi had sent them in his stead.

The adaptation really messed up here because the amount of time skips is inconsistent. 50 years have passed which should've been 5000 years in the void of the spatial rift.

218
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:23,620
I've been walking this path for endless years

219
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:23,620
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

220
00:17:24,260 --> 00:17:29,220
Is it the compass of fate

221
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:29,220
that wrote this outcome for us ?

222
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:35,140
The heavens want to erase your existence,

223
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:40,860
that's the obsession guiding me.

224
00:17:41,140 --> 00:17:46,460
Is this the path to uncover

225
00:17:43,020 --> 00:17:46,460
truths from falsehoods ?

226
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:52,060
In a world of murk and shadow,

227
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:52,060
only the flame of truth can light the way.

228
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:57,780
Look at them all,

229
00:17:54,980 --> 00:17:57,780
being carried by the waves.

230
00:17:58,220 --> 00:18:02,420
Look at them all,

231
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:02,420
being drowned.

232
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:05,740
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

233
00:18:05,780 --> 00:18:08,820
I will let the world refine my soul.

234
00:18:08,950 --> 00:18:14,380
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

235
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:14,380
I will fight.

236
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:17,500
I'll break through the abyss of despair

237
00:18:17,500 --> 00:18:20,540
to finally learn who I really am.

238
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:25,900
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

239
00:18:22,420 --> 00:18:25,900
I embrace this obsession.

240
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:28,860
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

241
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:31,660
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

242
00:18:31,660 --> 00:18:37,140
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

243
00:18:33,700 --> 00:18:37,140
I'll still fight.

244
00:18:37,340 --> 00:18:40,500
It's hard to avoid loneliness

245
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:43,540
when you are above everyone else.

246
00:18:43,540 --> 00:18:49,220
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

247
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:49,220
be afraid of a firefly ?
